(
    title: "Alphabet Zoo",
    description: Some("Race through a maze catching letters. In the Letter Game you grab the first letter of the picture in the centre — an M for a monkey — as many times as you can before time runs out; in the Spelling Game you collect every letter of the pictured word in order. Hyperspace circles in the corners fling you elsewhere in the maze."),
